WEBVTT

00:01:35.300 --> 00:01:37.530
Godai!
Time to rise and shine!

00:01:38.770 --> 00:01:40.030
Godai!

00:01:42.080 --> 00:01:44.440
Hurry! Your soup
is going to get cold.

00:01:44.520 --> 00:01:46.030
All right! I heard you.

00:01:46.110 --> 00:01:48.050
You're such a handful.

00:01:56.300 --> 00:01:59.320
How long is this
going to go on?

00:01:59.390 --> 00:02:01.720
- Huh?
- What do you mean, "Huh?"

00:02:01.800 --> 00:02:04.020
I'm talking about Godai
and that girl.

00:02:04.270 --> 00:02:05.220
Beats me.

00:02:06.500 --> 00:02:08.500
I know you're the one
that's bothered most.

00:02:10.570 --> 00:02:12.070
Oh, I almost forgot.

00:02:18.120 --> 00:02:21.310
That's right. It's almost
equinoctial week.

00:02:33.570 --> 00:02:38.630
Oh, that high school girl student did?
Poor Godai has his hands full.

00:02:38.660 --> 00:02:40.220
I wouldn't talk.

00:02:40.310 --> 00:02:43.260
You said you were cutting ties
with that marriage arrangement girl.

00:02:43.540 --> 00:02:45.380
What's going on, anyway?

00:02:46.000 --> 00:02:47.600
You haven't called it off yet, have you?

00:02:52.150 --> 00:02:53.730
W-Well...

00:02:53.880 --> 00:02:56.970
Coach Mitaka!
You have a phone call.

00:02:58.280 --> 00:02:59.120
Coming!

00:03:01.600 --> 00:03:04.090
I tell you.
All guys are hopeless.

00:03:05.160 --> 00:03:06.000
Hello?

00:03:07.100 --> 00:03:08.820
Oh, it's you, Uncle.

00:03:10.810 --> 00:03:12.320
What? Today?

00:03:14.200 --> 00:03:15.320
All right.

00:03:17.000 --> 00:03:18.870
Oh, my, Ms. Ichinose.

00:03:19.470 --> 00:03:21.470
You should've seen
my husband's face!

00:03:21.750 --> 00:03:23.700
You shouldn't say
things like that.

00:03:23.780 --> 00:03:24.970
Yeah, but...

00:03:37.790 --> 00:03:41.130
I can't have that dog maiden
hounding me forever.

00:03:42.260 --> 00:03:45.930
No matter what, I'm breaking
it off today for sure.

00:03:59.150 --> 00:04:02.230
Why are you suddenly
calling me out?

00:04:02.630 --> 00:04:04.850
I wanted to set a date to
exchange engagement gifts.

00:04:07.900 --> 00:04:10.190
Are you happy?
I know you are.

00:04:12.000 --> 00:04:13.250
What's wrong, Shun?

00:04:13.840 --> 00:04:15.740
Asuna is waiting.

00:04:24.180 --> 00:04:25.500
Welcome.

00:04:28.480 --> 00:04:29.330
Hello.

00:04:29.570 --> 00:04:31.870
My, my. Welcome.

00:04:32.050 --> 00:04:32.810
Hello.

00:04:33.750 --> 00:04:36.340
- This guy is just being shy.
- Uncle!

00:04:36.860 --> 00:04:41.150
And so, we'll take,care
of the details

00:04:41.320 --> 00:04:44.010
so you two go outside
and chat.

00:04:45.630 --> 00:04:48.450
Come now. You too, Asuna.
Go on.

00:04:51.500 --> 00:04:55.090
We'll have to meet
his parents first.

00:04:55.310 --> 00:04:58.300
Yes, yes. We'll have to
arrange that.

00:05:22.630 --> 00:05:25.800
It's already autumn, isn't it?

00:05:28.130 --> 00:05:28.860
Yes.

00:05:32.610 --> 00:05:34.830
- A-Actually...
- I...

00:05:38.710 --> 00:05:39.740
I...

00:05:42.560 --> 00:05:45.010
I love autumn.

00:05:48.250 --> 00:05:51.270
Oh! So do I!

00:05:52.540 --> 00:05:55.800
Spring, summer and winter too,

00:05:56.900 --> 00:06:00.130
as long as I'm by your side.

00:06:02.130 --> 00:06:02.960
I...

00:06:03.880 --> 00:06:05.810
I can't weaken now.

00:06:07.320 --> 00:06:12.570
Er...this isn't very easy
for me to say...

00:06:13.080 --> 00:06:15.770
But please hear me out.

00:06:17.150 --> 00:06:22.060
To tell you the truth,
I cannot marry you.

00:06:26.130 --> 00:06:30.930
I'm sorry I let it get this far
without being clear until now.

00:06:31.500 --> 00:06:32.330
Asuna...

00:06:37.610 --> 00:06:40.070
Ohh! Asuna!

00:06:40.440 --> 00:06:43.070
P-Please get ahold of yourself!

00:07:02.630 --> 00:07:07.630
Someone as beautiful as you
can have any man she wants.

00:07:09.900 --> 00:07:12.240
I will become a nun.

00:07:14.940 --> 00:07:18.700
- I will never ever marry.
- Don't say that!

00:07:22.010 --> 00:07:25.540
You must... hate me.

00:07:26.300 --> 00:07:29.380
No. I never said that.

00:07:38.170 --> 00:07:41.250
You don't... hate me?

00:07:42.110 --> 00:07:44.590
Of course not.
It's just...

00:07:45.000 --> 00:07:45.990
I understand.

00:07:48.840 --> 00:07:51.310
As long as I know that, I...

00:07:55.190 --> 00:07:57.010
You understand?!

00:07:57.690 --> 00:07:58.880
I do.

00:08:22.640 --> 00:08:24.240
Bye, Godai.

00:08:25.210 --> 00:08:26.440
I almost forgot.

00:08:27.290 --> 00:08:30.640
Godai, what would you
like for dinner tonight?

00:08:30.950 --> 00:08:33.690
Huh?
Let's get this clear...

00:08:34.060 --> 00:08:36.610
Hmm...
What about sukiyaki?

00:08:37.460 --> 00:08:38.300
Sure.

00:08:38.620 --> 00:08:39.920
I mean...

00:08:39.990 --> 00:08:41.580
I'll be home early.

00:08:41.830 --> 00:08:44.320
Make sure the meat
is nice and marbled.

00:08:46.540 --> 00:08:48.940
Well, doesn't she act
like the little woman.

00:08:50.010 --> 00:08:51.770
She should talk.

00:08:51.970 --> 00:08:54.200
What are you doing
from so early in the morning?

00:08:56.210 --> 00:08:57.970
Making building blocks.

00:08:58.050 --> 00:08:59.140
Building blocks?

00:08:59.210 --> 00:09:01.200
I'm going to paint them,
then draw pictures on them.

00:09:02.060 --> 00:09:03.070
Yoo hoo!

00:09:03.890 --> 00:09:05.790
M-Mr. Mitaka!

00:09:09.160 --> 00:09:11.080
Hello, Soichiro.

00:09:11.220 --> 00:09:15.080
- He looks awfully happy.
- Something must've happened.

00:09:15.400 --> 00:09:18.220
Sorry, but I don't have time
to play with you today.

00:09:21.310 --> 00:09:22.900
What happened?

00:09:23.340 --> 00:09:25.830
Ms. Otonashi, be happy.

00:09:26.070 --> 00:09:26.940
Yes?

00:09:27.470 --> 00:09:29.460
I've made you wait...

00:09:30.440 --> 00:09:32.310
but I finally
cut off my marriage arrangement.

00:09:32.840 --> 00:09:34.330
I'm a free man!

00:09:34.560 --> 00:09:39.610
The barrier between us has
been completely removed!

00:09:39.760 --> 00:09:40.780
Ms. Otonashi!

00:09:40.990 --> 00:09:42.110
Err...

00:09:42.190 --> 00:09:44.930
What are you doing here
from so early in the morning?

00:09:45.190 --> 00:09:47.160
You stay out of this.

00:09:47.440 --> 00:09:49.670
This is between Ms. Otonashi
and me.

00:09:49.730 --> 00:09:52.930
What a pity. That girl was
a good catch, wasn't she?

00:09:53.010 --> 00:09:56.070
The truth has been revealed!
I have no regrets.

00:09:57.150 --> 00:10:01.550
By the way, are you free
for lunch on Saturday?

00:10:01.840 --> 00:10:04.360
I'm sorry.
On Saturday...

00:10:05.740 --> 00:10:07.460
I have to visit
my husband's grave.

00:10:15.320 --> 00:10:18.440
That's right.
It's equinoctial week.

00:10:18.900 --> 00:10:21.320
I'm sorry.
I was insensitive.

00:10:21.400 --> 00:10:23.160
No, not at all.

00:10:23.460 --> 00:10:27.320
What were your husband's favorite
foods and flowers?

00:10:28.230 --> 00:10:31.590
- You're going with her?
- No, I'm just asking.

00:10:32.650 --> 00:10:34.330
He wasn't a picky man.

00:10:34.680 --> 00:10:36.540
I remember he liked
chrysanthemums.

00:10:36.740 --> 00:10:37.540
Chrysanthemums?

00:10:37.610 --> 00:10:39.840
Yes, because they could be
cooked with as well.

00:10:40.050 --> 00:10:43.840
Chrysanthemums, huh?
I'll see you later, Ms. Otonashi.

00:10:43.930 --> 00:10:46.080
Huh? Are you leaving already?

00:10:46.890 --> 00:10:50.910
I came to tell you that I called off
my engagement for you.

00:10:51.430 --> 00:10:55.920
Besides, it's not the right time
for you to let me in your heart.

00:11:03.510 --> 00:11:08.030
Whoa! So what are
you going to do, Kyoko?

00:11:08.110 --> 00:11:09.170
What do you mean?

00:11:09.370 --> 00:11:12.070
He might try to look cool
by proposing to you

00:11:12.210 --> 00:11:15.110
in front of your parents
at the grave.

00:11:15.420 --> 00:11:16.960
N-No way.

00:11:17.060 --> 00:11:18.600
You're so naive.

00:11:25.990 --> 00:11:29.560
Manager, may I use
your washing machine?

00:11:29.640 --> 00:11:30.610
Sure.

00:11:32.640 --> 00:11:35.220
He's a go-getter,
that Mitaka.

00:11:35.510 --> 00:11:39.450
Women like forceful men.

00:11:39.550 --> 00:11:44.640
Godai had better prepare himself.

00:11:44.740 --> 00:11:48.190
That guy is just too handy
for his own good.

00:12:14.010 --> 00:12:16.580
Thank you for watching
the house.

00:12:16.650 --> 00:12:21.110
Sure. Take as long as you need.
Tell your parents I said hello.

00:12:21.200 --> 00:12:22.910
I will. Bye!

00:12:40.140 --> 00:12:42.310
Oh, well. I guess I'll
go to work.

00:12:45.740 --> 00:12:49.180
Manager's family grave?
I think it was located...

00:12:49.730 --> 00:12:51.190
D-Don't tell me...

00:12:52.280 --> 00:12:57.310
- Mrs. Ichinose! Who was that?
- Guess...

00:12:57.490 --> 00:13:00.110
- M-Mitaka?
- That's right!

00:13:03.110 --> 00:13:06.360
He asked where Kyoko's
husband's grave was.

00:13:06.440 --> 00:13:10.020
Maybe he's thinking of proposing
to her in front of her parents

00:13:10.110 --> 00:13:12.390
at the gravesite.

00:13:13.080 --> 00:13:16.260
That shameless man would!
Damn it!

00:13:48.910 --> 00:13:50.080
Just as I suspected!

00:13:51.320 --> 00:13:52.480
Godai!

00:13:53.820 --> 00:13:56.310
Why are you here?

00:13:56.730 --> 00:14:00.220
I could ask you the same thing!
What do you have up your sleeve?

00:14:01.300 --> 00:14:04.020
I just came to pay my respects
to Kyoko's husband.

00:14:07.030 --> 00:14:10.150
And to tell him that I'll make
Kyoko happy.

00:14:11.530 --> 00:14:14.200
He gave me his blessing, too.

00:14:14.580 --> 00:14:16.810
How can you lie like that!

00:14:17.000 --> 00:14:19.990
I offered incense too.
I'm leaving. Out of my way!

00:14:20.950 --> 00:14:23.230
I'm sorry I'm late.

00:14:23.820 --> 00:14:26.110
Get out of here!
Hurry!

00:14:27.010 --> 00:14:31.210
- My husband got the time wrong.
- It's your fault!

00:14:31.280 --> 00:14:32.980
I see.

00:14:33.460 --> 00:14:36.110
My wife would often scold me
for the same thing.

00:14:36.200 --> 00:14:38.380
No, it's her fault.
She's to blame.

00:14:38.860 --> 00:14:41.100
Huh? Was someone here?

00:14:41.630 --> 00:14:44.620
Hmm... it looks like
they just left.

00:14:44.710 --> 00:14:47.570
My, what expensive-
looking bouquets.

00:14:47.630 --> 00:14:49.490
Who could have left them?

00:14:53.350 --> 00:14:54.530
This belongs to Godai.

00:14:57.980 --> 00:14:59.450
What are we going to do?

00:14:59.820 --> 00:15:02.370
We have no choice but to hide!

00:15:13.990 --> 00:15:16.650
I wonder why Godai was here.

00:15:18.110 --> 00:15:20.070
So these flowers are...

00:15:23.740 --> 00:15:25.610
Oh, my.
A card?

00:15:26.140 --> 00:15:27.360
Mr. Mitaka.

00:15:28.450 --> 00:15:30.810
You mean that Mr. Mitaka?

00:15:31.690 --> 00:15:33.510
Is he a friend of yours?

00:15:33.610 --> 00:15:36.370
Yes. She's dating him
right now.

00:15:36.460 --> 00:15:37.500
Mother!

00:15:39.190 --> 00:15:43.010
He's a coach at
the tennis school I attend.

00:15:43.200 --> 00:15:44.280
I see.

00:15:45.120 --> 00:15:48.360
That's not all he is.
Don't be shy.

00:15:48.470 --> 00:15:51.230
- What of it?
- You don't have to hide it.

00:15:51.310 --> 00:15:52.760
So what?

00:16:01.910 --> 00:16:08.050
I see. So you finally decided
to remarry. I see, I see.

00:16:08.750 --> 00:16:09.870
Father...

00:16:15.230 --> 00:16:18.120
I feel relieved.

00:16:18.200 --> 00:16:23.220
When I think about it, I felt bad that
you were bound to the Otonashi family.

00:16:23.400 --> 00:16:24.700
Er... that's...

00:16:25.160 --> 00:16:29.430
We have to report this news
to Soichiro.

00:16:29.500 --> 00:16:30.890
Just a minute, father.

00:16:31.000 --> 00:16:33.990
He'll be happy.
He will.

00:16:34.950 --> 00:16:36.610
Right, Soichiro?

00:16:37.910 --> 00:16:40.180
Father, I...

00:16:42.110 --> 00:16:45.950
You want to remarry, right?
Right, Kyoko?

00:16:55.530 --> 00:16:56.300
Yes.

00:16:58.360 --> 00:16:59.300
Kyoko!

00:16:59.370 --> 00:17:01.530
Kyoko!

00:17:02.430 --> 00:17:04.150
I do want to remarry.

00:17:06.580 --> 00:17:07.900
I do, but...

00:17:08.080 --> 00:17:09.460
Ms. Otonashi...

00:17:12.490 --> 00:17:15.080
Fancy meeting you here.

00:17:15.360 --> 00:17:17.760
Oh, my, Mr. Mitaka!

00:17:18.030 --> 00:17:21.950
Damn, that guy!
When did he...?

00:17:22.190 --> 00:17:24.990
I'm so glad you were still here.

00:17:25.220 --> 00:17:28.880
Yes, I was thinking of leaving,

00:17:29.190 --> 00:17:32.640
but I wanted to remember
where Soichiro's grave was.

00:17:32.810 --> 00:17:35.540
H-He's lying.

00:17:35.700 --> 00:17:38.630
Mr. Mitaka, this is Kyoko's
father-in-law.

00:17:38.940 --> 00:17:42.010
- You're Soichiro's father...
- Thank you for the flowers.

00:17:42.110 --> 00:17:45.520
Not at all. Please excuse me
for being so forward.

00:17:46.090 --> 00:17:49.250
Don't just stand there.
Say hello.

00:17:49.330 --> 00:17:51.180
I... well...

00:17:51.680 --> 00:17:52.940
Hurry.

00:17:54.560 --> 00:17:56.380
Hello...

00:17:56.460 --> 00:17:57.520
Nice to meet you.

00:17:59.070 --> 00:18:03.150
He's quite a handsome fellow, Kyoko.

00:18:04.570 --> 00:18:08.020
Why, you two make a nice couple.

00:18:08.470 --> 00:18:12.070
Yes. You seem almost
too good for Kyoko.

00:18:12.140 --> 00:18:13.340
Not at all.

00:18:14.110 --> 00:18:15.740
D-Damn!

00:18:15.910 --> 00:18:19.170
Instead of standing around here,
why don't we go and have some tea?

00:18:19.260 --> 00:18:20.780
Okay, Mr. Mitaka?

00:18:21.060 --> 00:18:21.990
S-Sure.

00:18:28.690 --> 00:18:30.860
Kyoko, what are you doing?

00:18:31.600 --> 00:18:35.860
Er...I'd like to stay at
the grave a little longer.

00:18:39.360 --> 00:18:42.860
Okay. We'll be waiting at
that coffee shop there then.

00:18:47.780 --> 00:18:52.670
Ms. Otonashi, I'm sorry.
This wasn't my intention.

00:18:52.880 --> 00:18:57.250
I just wanted to pay my respects
to your husband.

00:18:58.420 --> 00:19:00.940
I bet you think I'm lying.

00:19:01.220 --> 00:19:03.280
No, not at all.

00:19:04.620 --> 00:19:05.950
Mr. Mitaka!

00:19:06.740 --> 00:19:08.030
Coming!

00:19:09.570 --> 00:19:15.430
Please believe that I never intended
to disrupt your grave visiting.

00:19:18.940 --> 00:19:21.570
Humph, what a show off.

00:19:46.930 --> 00:19:48.270
Soichiro...

00:19:52.640 --> 00:19:56.940
Tell me... if I really did remarry,
would you feel better?

00:19:59.250 --> 00:20:01.540
Maybe it'll just make you
worry more...

00:20:09.220 --> 00:20:11.520
because he's not
very dependable...

00:20:16.770 --> 00:20:17.650
But...

00:20:23.350 --> 00:20:26.200
when it becomes spring,
I'm sure...

00:20:51.630 --> 00:20:54.150
B-But, Soichiro...

00:20:55.310 --> 00:21:00.570
I won't remarry right away.

00:21:02.870 --> 00:21:04.100
Godai!

00:21:04.490 --> 00:21:06.580
Don't you have to go
to the preschool?!

00:21:06.990 --> 00:21:08.970
The kids are waiting!

00:21:13.420 --> 00:21:15.830
E-Err...

00:21:22.570 --> 00:21:28.560
Soichiro, I will remain single
until the spring.

00:21:29.510 --> 00:21:30.360
What?

00:21:44.380 --> 00:21:48.900
M-Manager... I...
I'll do my best.

00:21:49.120 --> 00:21:52.030
I'll find a job and
become a real man.

00:21:52.390 --> 00:21:55.800
By... by spring, I promise you...

00:21:58.960 --> 00:22:00.120
Welcome!

00:22:00.470 --> 00:22:02.530
Kyoko! Over here!

00:22:06.370 --> 00:22:07.770
You're late.

00:22:08.080 --> 00:22:10.340
Yes, I got caught up.

00:22:12.290 --> 00:22:13.470
Welcome.

00:22:14.060 --> 00:22:16.050
- Coffee, please.
- Yes, ma'am.

00:22:18.090 --> 00:22:20.700
Oh, I'm so thirsty.

00:22:29.300 --> 00:22:33.220
We heard a lot from Mr. Mitaka.

00:22:33.400 --> 00:22:36.600
He told us he turned down a good
marriage arrangement for you.

00:22:38.940 --> 00:22:41.310
Please don't take it
the wrong way.

00:22:41.820 --> 00:22:47.010
I'm not asking her to marry me
because I turned the other girl down.

00:22:47.360 --> 00:22:51.110
To me, Ms. Otonashi is
my one and only

00:22:51.180 --> 00:22:53.370
whom I'll give up anything for.

00:22:53.620 --> 00:22:55.640
That's quite a resolve.

00:22:55.860 --> 00:22:58.210
You are so lucky, Kyoko!

00:23:00.660 --> 00:23:03.600
There is one thing I realized after
my marriage arrangement with Asuna.

00:23:03.900 --> 00:23:08.310
And that is to pursue the relationship
no matter how Kyoko feels.

00:23:08.540 --> 00:23:10.560
The power of my resolve
is something to be feared.

00:23:10.640 --> 00:23:12.430
Her father seems stubborn

00:23:12.510 --> 00:23:16.360
but I'll convince him by
playing it smart.

00:23:18.090 --> 00:23:20.490
I'm going to marry Kyoko,
no matter what...

00:23:22.710 --> 00:23:25.170
Got that, Ms. Otonashi?

00:23:28.300 --> 00:23:30.650
Huh? Err...

00:23:45.770 --> 00:23:48.230
Accept this, Godai.

00:23:48.310 --> 00:23:50.330
So you finally found a job, right?

00:23:50.410 --> 00:23:53.260
- No. I turned it down.
- What?!

00:23:53.510 --> 00:23:55.610
C'mon, Yagami.
Go home.

00:23:55.680 --> 00:23:59.420
Next: "You Go, Godai!
You Do Have Pride, After All"

00:23:59.480 --> 00:24:02.420
Why's he trying so hard
to look cool?
